| Tool     |      | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| -------- | ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `search` | read | One keyword across everything the account holds: posts, conversations (by contact **and** by what was said inside them), accounts, profiles, media, comment→DM rules, sequences, broadcasts, playbooks. Returns short results with an id and a link. |
